      "writtenOn": "2021-12-28T01:20:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Given that this class is called ProfileNetworkPreferences, then this object should always be associated with a profile. If that\u0027s the case, then the profile (which I assume means a UserHandle) should be required to construct the object, so probably it should be passed as an argument to the Builder constructor instead of a being a setter?\n\n(BTW: if a profile is a UserHandle, then should this be called UserNetworkPreference? Or did we prefer ProfileNetworkPreference for consistency with the already-shipped setProfileNetworkPreference API?)",
      "range": {
