      "writtenOn": "2021-12-28T01:20:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should document what happens if this method is called twice. Will it replace any previous preference set by this method for this user? That seems like the most natural behaviour here.\n\nHowever, if those are the semantics, then it will not be possible to use this method for a DPC to say, \"put apps A, B, and C onto this network, but apps X, Y, and Z onto this other network\". At least if the proposed API shape looks like the one in aosp/1905551 where the list of UIDs is part of this object.",
